# 📊 Exploration Project - Homelessness 

## 📌 Project Summary
Briefly explain:
- What problem are you solving? We are condensing the states and locations of the available homeless shelters that can be easily found by those in need. 
- Why does it matter? It matters to have a organized dataset, so that the information can be found and read easily by those in need or searching for it. 
- What type of data are you analyzing? I am analyzing the CoC_Number, the CoC_Name, and the State in which the homeless facilities are located. 

## 📂 Dataset
- Source: BigQuery public dataset
- Description: What does the dataset include? CoC_number, CoC_Name, State, Overall_Homeless, Sheltered_ES_Homeless, Sheltered_TH_Homeless, Sheltered_SH_Homeless, Sheltered_Total_Homeless, Unsheltered_Homesless, Homeless_Individuals, Homeless_People_in_Families, Chronically_Homeless, Homeless_Veterans, Homeless_Unaccompanied_Youth_Under_18, Count_Year 
- Size: 2,768 rows 

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies
- SQL (BigQuery)

